  - GNU Free Documentation License (GFDL), version 1.3 or later
    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/fdl-1.3.html

Attribution: the contributors of the English Wiktionary; extraction by
Wiktextract (Tatu Ylonen), https://kaikki.org. Modifications: the packs keep,
per headword, the parts of speech, senses (up to twelve per part of speech,
glosses truncated to 300 characters), tags, one IPA pronunciation, and
redirects from inflected forms to their lemma; everything else in the source
records is omitted. The packs are re-encoded into Pellet's binary format.

